OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter the overnight rain clears
OL,6,Fsouthern areas around sunrise, there
OL,7,Fwill be sunny spells today, but
OL,8,Ffeeling markedly cooler than previous
OL,9,Fdays in a breezy northwesterly. Cloudy
OL,10,Fspells in the afternoon and the odd
OL,11,Fshower, mainly for western coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FTonight, showers will fade
OL,14,Fbut, under clear skies and with easing
OL,15,Fwinds, temperatures will drop to the
OL,16,Flow single-figures. There may be a
OL,17,Ftouch of grass frost in sheltered
OL,18,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
