OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FTomorrow will begin with
OL,6,Flots of sunshine and light winds, but
OL,7,Ffeeling autumnal in the cool
OL,8,Fnorthwesterly breeze. Cloud will
OL,9,Fthicken through the afternoon with
OL,10,Frain arriving by the evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain,
OL,13,Fsometimes heavy, will clear through
OL,14,FFriday morning to become bright with
OL,15,Fscattered showers and strong winds.
OL,16,FSimilar during Saturday, but Sunday
OL,17,Fwill be cloudy with winds and showers
OL,18,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
